  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II Climate Smart Agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate smart agriculture in Sub-Saharan Africa: capacity development for improved resistance to climate change. Important target groups for the project are staff and students in agriculture, small-scale farmers (particular focus on women and youth), professionals in extension services, policy actors, NGOs and government institutions. University staff and students will be involved through MSc, PhD and post doc scholarships, curriculum development, summer schools and scientific exchange.</narrative>
  </description>
